# Keep the build context small and correct.
#
# node_modules matters most: copying a host-built tree into the image bakes in
# native binaries for the WRONG ARCHITECTURE. Building on an x86 laptop for an
# ARM VM would produce an image whose Prisma engine and Chromium cannot run.
# Every Dockerfile installs dependencies inside the image instead.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Prisma client — regenerated inside the image for the target arch.
packages/db/generated

# Secrets must never enter a build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local state that has no business in an image.
storage/
services/scraper/debug/
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
test-results
playwright-report

.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
